1213 |     $u,v \in \verts Y$ a pair of subspaces
1214 |     $S^e_u \subset \piece v, S^e_v \subset \piece y$ whose stabilizers
1215 |     are the images of $Y_e$ in the respective vertex groups an
1216 |     \define{identification isometry} $S^e_u \stackrel{\sim}{\to} S^e_v$.
