1386 |     \rho_{\flap_i}\left(Z_\churro\right)} \bar g\cdot
1387 |   \flapfam{\flap_i}\] and for each $\bar g\in \rho_{\flap_i}\left(Z_\churro\right)$ we chose chose an
1388 | element $\flap_i^{\bar g} \in \bar g\cdot \flapfam{\flap_i}$ and define the
1389 | action \[ g\cdot \flap_i = \flap_i^{\bar g},
1390 | \] which is well defined since $\rho_{\flap_i}$ is a homomorphism.
1391 | Now if $g \cdot \flap_i = \flap_i$,
1392 | 
1393 | then $g$ extends naturally from an
