1397 | action by automorphisms\begin{equation}\label{eq:Z-action} Z_\churro
1398 |   \actson \left(\churrocore \cup \left(\bigcup_{g \in Z_\churro}
1399 |       g\cdot \flap_i\right)\right).
1400 | \end{equation}
